<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-8" align="justify">
                <h3><b>Testing and Release Readiness</b></h3>

                <p>
                    Release readiness ensures that a product is technically stable,
                    functionally complete, and operationally prepared before deployment.
                    Establishing clear readiness criteria reduces production risks and
                    improves confidence across stakeholders.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Complete functional and integration testing for planned release features.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Perform regression testing to verify existing functionality remains stable.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Validate performance, security, and reliability requirements where applicable.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Confirm critical defects have been resolved or formally accepted.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Verify deployment procedures, documentation, monitoring, and support readiness.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4 text-center">
                @* Add the relevant testing image here when available. *@
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

