                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Share release timelines, scope changes, risks, and readiness updates.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Prepare release notes and customer-facing product information.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Coordinate product, development, QA, operations, sales, and support teams.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Establish escalation paths for critical issues and unexpected release changes.</p>
